  "bodyHash": "0cbbd57246612576",
  "content": "<h2>Этот мод добавляет рецепты для предметов, которые невозможно скрафтить в ванильной версии. Чтобы увидеть рецепт, пожалуйста, посмотрите изображение.</h2>\n<p>Я настоятельно рекомендую вам использовать <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frei%252fversion%252f18.0.804%2bfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmine-spawners%252fversion%252faMAMQxLy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mine Spawners</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fobtainable-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obtainable End</a> или мой собственный мод <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbreakable-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Breakable Blocks</a>.</p>\n&lt;center&gt; \n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aada0ab88dd3aec82e2a9b6cc1a0707f38a8118b.png\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>Рецепт яиц призыва</h1>\n<p>Все яйца призыва можно скрафтить, вы можете увидеть тот же рецепт в <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcraft-spawn-eggs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craft Spawn Eggs</a></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Эндер Дракона</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5fe3102c6f9c94af9df9758a8864427ac0a10f41.jpeg\" alt=\"ed\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Визера</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9be66dd9aab0feec9f29be61274edaaea9574633.png\" alt=\"ww\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Медного голема</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c5cbf88d2a06acc6a3d87269f183cc30072ac97b.jpeg\" alt=\"copper golem\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Верблюд-Скелет</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/354fc19f2345de41595ccd3fa3a2b2b2abe76e73.jpeg\" alt=\"Camel Husk\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Высушенный</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/047c71a30799cc01cd4803ac0f2b9197734417c8.jpeg\" alt=\"parched\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Наутрус</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c08c454b9dee5ea1fa1b1a79740a571fa97e663f.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus\"></p>\n<h3>Яйцо призыва Зомби Наутрус</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6d319afaa6d8f417d5f18cd66bcca44ef1bcda93.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus Z\"></p>\n<h1>Предметы и блоки</h1>\n<h3>Тотем бессмертия</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/84807850dd73232807b42ad3bfb7f1b136ffdd1f.png\" alt=\"totem\"></p>\n<h3>Монструозный спавнер</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1bcc3f4033071380475cf4b2872f6133ee66ba66.png\" alt=\"spawner\"></p>\n<h3>Зачарованное золотое яблоко</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70ecc176db1f79dfa15ec43faa7d37cc6293dd60.png\" alt=\"ega\"></p>\n<h3>Седло</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/339c9ce6d4ac65de9225937a6a6c37bbb67d2e2e.png\" alt=\"saddle\"></p>\n<h3>Элитры</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8e867bcec7364a48eff4c76a90c799ef9679f3.png\" alt=\"elytra\"></p>\n<h3>Бирка</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/167926d00a5f785ac6bf17b0969107dde6dd2998.png\" alt=\"Name Tag\">!</p>\n<h3>Трезубец</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b6f89594f7c95fa98200b981647baa066467e68.png\" alt=\"tr\"></p>\n<h3>Рамка портала в Энд</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af5ea409836e2281d9828da40ed4667d89587f41.png\" alt=\"end\"></p>\n<h1>Конская броня</h1>\n<h3>Кожаная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3f0ec052aaf228a5095670c46689ecd85473f00.png\" alt=\"l\"></p>\n<h3>Железная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/94d26a73f8a7bd5388a7421266b180d44169f1a9.png\" alt=\"i\"></p>\n<h3>Медная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27d538f6112de59a5e1f9799f56b78734ad4d37a.jpeg\" alt=\"copper horse\"></p>\n<h3>Золотая</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4876047c5c27038997716c89729837143aa95555.png\" alt=\"g\"></p>\n<h3>Алмазная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/056605790622f9fa71cee068916b3557a9271561.png\" alt=\"d\"></p>\n<h1>Броня из наутруса</h1>\n<h3>Железная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4807c7e8b5e31c4404db1ca8e076c743ada1e1b_0.webp\" alt=\"nautilus iron\"></p>\n<h3>Медная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c43313ba71215a18e9377c0b1f4d9f5ea5ea8f50.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus copper\"></p>\n<h3>Золотая</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6e85460100d5ade67b44a7377ce2c5ecfde6b80.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus gold\"></p>\n<h3>Алмазная</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6a06ffa6aea504102587d7153b0f90e501bca71.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus d\"></p>\n<h1>Цепная броня</h1>\n<h3>Цепь</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e924f8202f9f6c86fac8d5f7bd46d09c9008d469.png\" alt=\"c\"></p>\n<h3>Шлем</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4fe0bfe3f150b5d5ca6614be4ee9e23c62feddb.png\" alt=\"h\"></p>\n<h3>Нагрудник</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aad186ee5ac469fa1898dc8990e09b8d8ea043f.png\" alt=\"c\"></p>\n<h3>Поножи</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8381e5828c720f60520cc17fc67b7a8ce63c8662.png\" alt=\"l\"></p>\n<h3>Ботинки</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de70e6fa559f5717bdfcb66731e9d1cfb14adf99.png\" alt=\"b\"></p>\n<h1>Незерит</h1>\n<h3>Незеритовый апгрейд</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1337a69ccdd8ac0f8a74639daa1e4df78a471dbb.png\" alt=\"n1\"></p>\n<h3>Меч</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ac1be519ff7b1e6b1577a28a1e4bbf9e770d5d3.png\" alt=\"n2\"></p>\n<h3>Лопата</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0a3b824ebb494a986c56405d4dc234bb7ccde11d.png\" alt=\"n3\"></p>\n<h3>Кирка</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e863dc945f77d1d66025c0dc9093d639765b281a.png\" alt=\"n4\"></p>\n<h3>Топор</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51a7d0f98b00e84a83b1c479e944a6227adfef2b.png\" alt=\"n5\"></p>\n<h3>Мотыга</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c6edcde7f132dce5841b46764121c046c5a360b.png\" alt=\"n6\"></p>\n<h3>Шлем</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8d5989c6df493023a3f1e617b7559ffb128e77.png\" alt=\"n7\"></p>\n<h3>Нагрудник</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75749b034fb9b50e42ea5dd7204b0c68e62a170e.png\" alt=\"n8\"></p>\n<h3>Поножи</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1aabb8d2e55d8c4b8fe438beb1ecb4aadce5eb41.png\" alt=\"n9\"></p>\n<h3>Ботинки</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e3c331db00b3b4a96f06a065adf199a10e77607.png\" alt=\"n10\"></p>",
